. ३२; M. १२९. १६; १७२. १०; वा. ६७. ६९; ७०. ८१; ९०. ३३.
Here विष्णु killed कालनेमि, and Indra, Viro- cana, son of प्रह्लाद; (Virocana was killed by विष्णु in the [page२-020+ २९] guise of Indra-वा। प्।). After the war there was a famine when वसिष्ठ helped the people with fruits and roots;
